+## [v0.1.10-test.1] - 2026-11-24
+
+> Experimental candidate; full Android CI and vehicle validation pending.
+> 实验候选版，完整 Android CI 与实车验证尚未完成。
+
+### English
+- Reject incomplete ctrl requests and obsolete invitation callbacks.
+- Scope invitation waiting and retries to the current connection.
+- Keep unverified authentication evidence distinct from actual verification.
